// Unit Infos
// UNIT_SENTINEL is this game's own (docs/SIEGES.md): never trained or placed on the map; the
//     Sentinels of a walled city fight in battles with its stats and rows, their HP, defence and
//     magic defence grown by the city's defence.
// This game's own fields (docs/UNIT_STATS.md, docs/ENGAGEMENTS.md "Per-unit values"):
//     stats: a land unit's numbers in a battle: hp, attack, defense, magic (its spells; 0: it
//         casts nothing), magic_defense, accuracy (its chance to hit before the target's
//         evasion), evasion, crit (its crit chance), speed. Promotions change them
//         (stat_changes in promotions.jsonc).
//     combat_role overrides the role a unit takes from its unit combat (the religions' fighters,
//         which never cast, are COMBATROLE_FRONTLINE although disciples are support); large: a
//         large unit in a formation battle (two cells, two slots); engage_rows (three rows,
//         front, middle, rear, each an action and its count) replace the role's rows.
//     combat and combat_defense stay the unit's strength outside land battles (ships, the
//         rules that read strength, the AI's power estimates).
